Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}一台小吉普，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}十九个人要救，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}前面还堵着四辆坦克。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.18,0:00:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}赤色要塞，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}开打！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}先用手雷炸开营房，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}再靠过去接人上车。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}车后座越来越挤，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}这趟救援可不能白跑。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.11,0:00:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}闪光俘虏就是关键补给。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}接上车，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}手雷直接升级成火箭，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.97,0:00:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}火力终于跟上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}营地大门也能炸开。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.91,0:00:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}冲进去继续救人，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}武器还能升到双向，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.61,0:00:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}再到四向火箭。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}过桥先处理守桥坦克，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}接走闪光俘虏。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.21,0:00:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}看左上角，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.41,0:00:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}四向火箭到手，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}救人和变强是一条线。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.18,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}找到直升机坪，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.65,0:00:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}停稳交接。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.11,0:00:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}车上的人数往下减，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.93,0:00:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}已送达往上加，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}十九个人，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.47,0:00:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}一个不少。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.74,0:00:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}最后是四辆蓝色坦克。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.13,0:00:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}先对准再开火，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.65,0:00:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}贴太近就往侧面拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}挨炮后护甲确实会掉，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}无限命可不是无敌。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}最后一辆也解决了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}第一关救援完成，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}接下来进废墟城。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}第二关换成废墟城，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}石柱、窄路和敌人的交叉火力，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}路线一下变得紧张了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}这一下没躲开，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}吉普被打爆了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}复活能继续，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}但武器回到手雷，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.85,0:01:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}还是得重新救人，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}把火力补起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}绕进营地再炸营房，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}接回闪光俘虏，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}武器重新升级。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.33,0:01:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}后面还有修理补给，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}掉血也有机会救回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.19,0:01:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}废墟城这一趟，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}十五个人也全部送到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.91,0:01:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}穿过石桥，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}继续往北打。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.58,0:01:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}第二关的关底换成四座石像。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.58,0:01:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}对准石像开火，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:01:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}还要留意追过来的导弹和坦克。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.73,0:01:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}最后一座打掉，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}两关通了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}方向键移动，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.89,0:02:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}机枪跟着车头转，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}手雷也朝车头扔。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}按一下 C，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.43,0:02:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}还能切换俯视和近景。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.80,0:02:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}这一版已经把救人、升级和两关战斗串起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.85,0:02:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}你更想继续打磨吉普转向，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.21,0:02:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}还是手雷手感？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.10,0:02:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}这段是十月四日的双关卡实录。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}当前试玩入口见简介，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}操作以游戏内提示为准。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}我们下次再见！
